# 统一行尾：仓库内文本文件一律 LF（索引与工作区）。
# 避免 Windows（core.autocrlf=true）检出 CRLF 导致 shared 契约漂移检查误报；二进制文件不转换。
* text=auto eol=lf
# Vendored upstream bytes are pinned by provenance/release SHA-256 checks.
# Preserve their original line endings across staging and cross-platform clones.
server/cad-engine/core/vendor/ezdxf/** -text
